  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: fbc59c66082806145ba8b7e8ab53aa37, type: 3}
  m_Name: Intro
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::MarsSampling.DialogueSequence
  lines:
  - speaker: Good Luck (radio)
    text: Morning! Or whatever this is. Sol-time. You made it down in one piece -
      already ahead of the last student.
  - speaker: Good Luck (radio)
    text: I'm your field colleague. Big Boss calls me 'Good Luck', which I choose
      to read as a name and not a warning.
  - speaker: Good Luck (radio)
    text: 'He was supposed to brief you. He is... not here. He is never here. So:
      ten rock samples, one duplicate, fifty metres minimum between sites. It''s
      all on your tablet.'
  - speaker: Good Luck (radio)
    text: Bags first - protocol. The white box by the rover. Count them, confirm
      the numbering.
